Date: Thu, 15 May 2025 21:57:50 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-210720] sensord: use set sensor threshold

Store user provided threshold information in boot_info to be used by
preboot for next hbm run.

Change-Id: Ie00b0001e38fc215aee9985edf16ebbf64d2a3e0
Signed-off-by: David Kershner <dkershner@habana.ai>
---

